    "accessLimits": "Ghana1996 primary abstract verified; Ghana2002 follow-up primary indexed abstract verified through EuropePMC MED12625130 (no indication of increased later mortality through2000). Tanzania2022 prospective-cohort primary institutional abstract verified. These support survival persistence qualitatively, not the numerical survival schedule. Accounts indexedprimary passages inspected, not fullPDF."
  },
  "judgments": {
    "mortality": ".015 annual allcause risk per6–59month child-year is analyst planning prior for unknown marginal campaign; not under5deaths perlivebirth, not measured AMF weightedrate.",
    "coverage": "Fractions .8/.5/.2 are trial-equivalent functionalprotection, not use measurement; three annualintervals, zero beyond. Children ageout/newentrants represented by population personyears. Central year3 protection is an extrapolation beyond the two-year Ghana trial. The .8/.5/.2 functional fractions are relative to the trial-level community package, not an independently measured dose-response or literal fraction of unique individual netusers. No extra herd-benefit multiplier.",
    "additionality": "Combined funding/output additionality beyond otherdonors and alreadyfunctionalnets; no second funding or samepartnercredit.",
    "cost": "Central$3cash commodity+$3otherresources, alljudgment informed by AMF$2commodity/$4.50delivered illustrations; nonnetcosts funded separately are notfree.",
    "survival": "Finite analyst survivaldifference afterearlydeath: persistentFraction*annualSurvival^(k-.5), utility weighted,3%discount. Not a sourced lifetable or automaticfullremaininglifespan. Zero beyond horizon. The .8 persistentFraction gives zero longterm credit to the remaining .2; it is cautious analyst shrinkage, not an observed catch-up rate. Background survival, utility and truncation horizon are uncalibrated priors. Donation delay and postdeath discount are separate time intervals, not two discounts for the same year.",
    "harm": "Sharedharm scaled byadditionality, independentharm atgift outside. No empiricallycalibrated resistance/ecologicalharm estimate.",
    "excluded": "No morbidity/adult/pregnancy/productivity/transmissionextra or GiveWellmoralweights; Baydirect0, indirectunmeasured/zero credited.",
    "resourcePerspective": "Legacy resourceCostUsd/resourceUsdPer10Qaly fields are GROSS associated full-package resource sensitivities: charge cash plus estimated partner costs for every sponsored net, even where other financing might replace it. They are not net societal incremental costs. Substitution could reduce net resources; medical savings/consumption costs not estimated. Co-funded overhead, volunteer labor and logistics allowance included once; commodity price not added twice.",
    "ranges": "Favorable/pessimistic are joint analyst scenarios, not probability intervals. Favorable .25 relativeeffect is not Binka's pointestimate; no scenario weights or expected-value aggregation established."
  },
  "formulas": {
    "L": "persistentFraction*utility*sum[k=1..H](annualSurvival^(k-.5)/1.03^(k-.5))",
    "E": "sum[i=0..2](coverage[i]/1.03^(delay+i+.5))",
    "D": "people*childShare*mortality*rrr*transport*additionality*E",
    "QperNet": "D*L-additionality*sharedHarm/1.03^(delay+.5)-independentHarm",
    "ratio": "10*price/QperNet iff positive else null",
    "resources": "10*(price+extra)/QperNet iff positive else null"
  },
